            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Subsection 542(3) (table, heading to column headed “Power”)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the heading, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>Powers and functions</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>Subsection 542(3) (after table item 26)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <table>
                  <tr>
                    <td>26A</td>
                    <td>To arrange for the use of computer programs for purposes related to making certain decisions under this Act and any other power or function conferred by section 541A</td>
                    <td>Section 541A</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>Subsection 576(1) (at the end of the note)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add “A decision that the Director of Biosecurity is taken to have made because of subsection 541A(5) is not a decision made by the Director of Biosecurity personally (see subsection 541A(6)).”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8">
