                <p>Omit “Note”, substitute “Note 1”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9">
              <num>9</num>
              <heading>At the end of subsection 578(1) (after the note)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-5" marker="5">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note 2:	A decision that the Director of Biosecurity is taken to have made because of subsection 541A(5) is not a decision made by the Director of Biosecurity personally (see subsection 541A(6)).</p>
                  </content>
                </authorialNote>
